    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "When browsing files with mini.files it is impossible to see which files have modified/unsaved changes. \r\nA visual indicator (such as a different color or an icon) for modified files would greatly improve usability. Having an option to set this as a parameter in .setup() would be nice. I can open a PR if you dont mind merging it as a feature",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">When browsing files with mini.files it is impossible to see which files have modified/unsaved changes.<br>\nA visual indicator (such as a different color or an icon) for modified files would greatly improve usability. Having an option to set this as a parameter in .setup() would be nice. I can open a PR if you dont mind merging it as a feature</p>",
    "bodyText": "When browsing files with mini.files it is impossible to see which files have modified/unsaved changes.\nA visual indicator (such as a different color or an icon) for modified files would greatly improve usability. Having an option to set this as a parameter in .setup() would be nice. I can open a PR if you dont mind merging it as a feature",
